        "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/CleveArguelles/status/1974457193924829209",
        "text": "This is why our next protest must be sooner— and bigger. We need to strike real and enduring fear at the heart of the political class. They now wait for the public to blink so they can all get away with it save for a few of their friends who may be sacrificed now but bailed out later. The new Senate leadership is facing a silent coup among some members of the majority who may switch sides and support the return of a Duterte-led Senate if the corruption investigations hit their backyards too. As they scramble to protect the old older, we need our bodies back on the street!",
